      <div class="section-label">The short answer</div>
      <h2>What are AI lead generation services?</h2>
      <p><strong>AI lead generation services use artificial intelligence, sales data, and human execution to find better prospects, understand account context, prioritize outreach, qualify opportunities, and create sales conversations.</strong></p>
      <p>At CallTeam, AI is not the salesperson. It is the intelligence layer behind the salesperson. It helps us make sharper decisions before a real person picks up the phone.</p>
      <div class="ai-truth-line">The database gives you names. AI gives you context. The call tells you what is real.</div>
