  <section id="how-it-works">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-label">The CallTeam process</div>
      <h2>Define → discover → detect → research → call → qualify → book.</h2>
      <div class="steps ai-process-steps">
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-num">1</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Define the Ideal Customer Profile</h3>
            <p>We clarify the market, strongest-fit company types, buyer roles, deal profile, exclusions, geography, qualification standard, and the business problem your offer solves.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-num">2</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Discover Best-Fit Accounts and People</h3>
            <p>We can build a new prospect universe or work from your CRM, target-account list, inbound leads, event leads, LinkedIn prospects, past opportunities, or existing data.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-num">3</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Detect Useful Signals</h3>
            <p>Where data is available, we review business triggers, first-party activity, CRM history, and third-party intent clues that can improve timing or account priority.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-num">4</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Research, Enrich, and Prioritize</h3>
            <p>Account context, contact data, role relevance, signal quality, and campaign value are organized into a call-ready queue with human review.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-num">5</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Make the Human Cold Call</h3>
            <p>An experienced caller opens the conversation, confirms the right person, tests the reason for calling, handles early resistance, and listens for what the data could not show.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-num">6</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Qualify What Is Real</h3>
            <p>We use agreed criteria to assess company fit, role, need, interest, timing, current process, authority path, and whether a next step makes sense.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-num">7</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Book, Report, and Improve</h3>
            <p>Qualified conversations move forward with useful notes. Objections, referrals, list issues, and market feedback improve the next calling round.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

