      <p>AI appointment-setting tools often focus on scheduling automation. CallTeam focuses on the commercial work before the calendar link.</p>
      <p>Is the company a fit? Is this the right person? Is there a relevant issue? Is there openness to a conversation? Does the next step match what the prospect actually said?</p>
