  <section class="who">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-label">Data quality and human review</div>
      <h2>AI moves faster when the data is good. It moves confidently in the wrong direction when the data is bad.</h2>
      <p>Strong AI prospecting still needs clean inputs, sensible rules, usable contact data, clear exclusions, and human inspection.</p>
      <p>A job title may be stale. A company description may be vague. A funding event may have no connection to your offer. A third-party intent score may sit at the account level without identifying the actual buyer. A generated company summary may miss the operational reality.</p>
      <p>That is why CallTeam treats AI output as a working hypothesis. We use it to make the next decision better, then verify what matters through data review and live conversation.</p>
      <div class="kicker">A confident machine answer is not the same thing as a verified sales fact.</div>
    </div>
  </section>

